{"audit_run_id":"audit:e3f8db4b8efd440598b7205e79604250","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":96,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"Sediment cores from a coastal mangrove survey. A twelve-year-old restored stand and an adjacent"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"undisturbed natural stand of the same species were sampled on the same shoreline during a single"},{"end_column":98,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"survey. Forty-eight cores were taken to 30 centimetres depth, twenty-four in each stand, and each"},{"end_column":42,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"core was analysed once in the laboratory."},{"end_column":95,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"One row is one sediment core: its identifier, the stand it came from, and the three laboratory"},{"end_column":90,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"measurements made on that core. There are 48 rows plus a header row, and no blank values."},{"end_column":39,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| Column | Type | Unit | Description |"},{"end_column":26,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":215,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `core_id` | text | none | Identifier for the sediment core. Unique across the file. Cores from the restored stand are numbered `R01` through `R24`; cores from the natural stand are numbered `N01` through `N24`. |"},{"end_column":225,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `stand_type` | text | none | Which stand the core came from. Exactly two values: `restored` for the twelve-year-old restored stand, `natural` for the adjacent undisturbed natural stand. Twenty-four rows carry each value. |"},{"end_column":156,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `organic_carbon_pct` | number | percent of dry mass | Sediment organic carbon in the core, as a percentage of dry mass. Recorded to two decimal places. |"},{"end_column":129,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `bulk_density_g_cm3` | number | grams per cubic centimetre | Dry bulk density of the core. Recorded to three decimal places. |"},{"end_column":135,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| `total_nitrogen_mg_g` | number | milligrams per gram of dry sediment | Total nitrogen in the core. Recorded to two decimal places. |"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"The three measurement columns appear in the order the survey plan declared the outcomes: organic"},{"end_column":54,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"carbon first, then bulk density, then total nitrogen."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:8b770feb361541fa55d6","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:80682cb5fb7202decf6a92041a47b7042c0dae8317f45c03b2e1d062208dc7c0","end_line":24,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-24","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:e3f8db4b8efd440598b7205e79604250","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":86,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `stand_type` column of `data.csv`."},{"end_column":119,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: organic_carbon_pct, bulk_density_g_cm3, total_nitrogen_mg_g."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:52d24e8d6e17c75960f4","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:e4bff17cc4abb248e3afa25e6cf6194dd52e8f7aa2c0fea4b2192b3ffdd070d8","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
